// wave_defense stress fixture (task #243): early-wave spawn (count=8).
//
// One of four wave-size-tier abilities (SpawnSmall=8, SpawnMedium=16,
// SpawnLarge=32, SpawnHorde=64) that ramp the wave size as `world.tick`
// crosses tier thresholds. Path B from the plan: tick-windowed `when`
// gates on the per-tier verbs in `wave_defense.sim` pick exactly one
// spawn verb per spawner per `wave_period`, so the dispatched
// `apply_ability N` literal varies with tick — no DSL extension
// needed. See the SpawnSmall verb in wave_defense.sim for the gate.
//
// Per `apply_summon_event_to_state`, count=8 packs into the
// EffectSummonApplied chronicle record's slot[4] (count widened from
// u8). The runtime drains the records and allocates 8 monster slots
// per cast at the spawner's pos.
//
// `cooldown: 3s` (= 30 ticks) matches the .sim's `wave_period` config
// value so the cooldown gate stays in the verb's `when` clause and the
// registry's program.cooldown_ticks field is informational only.

ability SpawnSmall {
    target: self
    cooldown: 3s
    hint: utility

    summon "monster" 8 [UTILITY: 100]
}
